  "poe": {
    "budgetW": 400,
    "sourceUrl": "https://brandcentral.cambiumnetworks.com/asset/c544bc91-c854-4589-a6e6-94864102a2d9/cnMatrix-EX2000-Data-Sheet.pdf",
    "note": "400 W PoE+ budget at 54 V for 48 ports at 30 W maximum each - so the budget, not the port rating, binds: 48 x 30 W is 1440 W of port capability against a 400 W supply. 802.3af/at only; the data sheet lists no 802.3bt or 60 W port on this model."
  },
  "fabric": {
    "capacityMbps": 176000,
    "kind": "switching fabric",
    "note": "Data sheet 'Throughput' of 176 Gbps, the full-duplex aggregate of 48 x 1G plus 4 x 10G. Forwarding rate 120 Mpps."
  },
  "sourceUrl": "https://brandcentral.cambiumnetworks.com/asset/c544bc91-c854-4589-a6e6-94864102a2d9/cnMatrix-EX2000-Data-Sheet.pdf",
  "notes": "48 copper PSE ports numbered 1-48 and four SFP+ cages numbered 49-52 (positional numbering; no CLI name is printed in the data sheet). 44 x 4.4 x 35 cm, 5.4 kg, two internal fans (48.5 dB under 33 C, 54 dB above 43 C), 39.24 W maximum switch power with traffic and no PoE. Fully managed Layer 2/3 switch, managed by cloud or on-premises cnMaestro and by an industry-standard CLI, with embedded web management, a DHCP server and client, DHCP relay, OSPFv2 and RIPv1/v2 (static routes and inter-VLAN routing included), LACP/static LAGs, RSTP/MSTP/PVRST, ERPSv1, QinQ, IGMP snooping v1/v2, LLDP/LLDP-MED, 802.1X/MAB, DHCP snooping, dynamic ARP inspection, per-port flow control and storm control. 16 K MAC table, 4 K VLANs, 9 K jumbo frames, 800 MHz CPU, 128 MB flash, 512 MB DRAM, 1.5 MB packet buffer. 100-240 VAC supply, 1U rack mountable, 0-50 C operating, -40 to 70 C storage, 55 C at 95% RH. RS-232 serial console (RJ-45) on every model, plus a USB port and an out-of-band Ethernet management port: the spec table lists the management port but states its rate only for the EX2028-P (10/100 Mbps), so it is recorded here rather than modelled as a data port at a rate no document gives. Sources: cnMatrix EX2000 Series data sheet https://brandcentral.cambiumnetworks.com/asset/c544bc91-c854-4589-a6e6-94864102a2d9/cnMatrix-EX2000-Data-Sheet.pdf and the model page https://www.cambiumnetworks.com/products/switching/."
}
